---

<BaseLayout
  title="关于"
  description="关于 MISIRO：一个写构建、性能与界面实验的静态技术博客，以及它的作者与工作方式。"
>

  <!-- HERO：档案封面 -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container about-hero__grid">
      <span class="about-ghost" aria-hidden="true" data-ghost>ABOUT</span>

      <div class="hero-index" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="hero-index__num mono">00</span>
        <span class="hero-index__kicker mono">COVER</span>
        <span class="hero-index__cn">封面</span>
        <span class="hero-index__spine"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="about-hero__lead">
        <span class="sticker">ABOUT / 关于</span>
        <h1 class="about-hero__title glitch">
          关于<span class="about-hero__slash">/</span>我
        </h1>
        <p class="about-hero__desc">
          这里是一份公开的工程日志——把构建当作作品，把性能当作约束，把界面当作实验场。
        </p>
        <ul class="about-hero__chips">
          {idTags.map((tag) => <li class="mono">{tag}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="about-hero__side">
        <div class="hero-file mono">
          <div class="hero-file__row"><span>FILE</span><span>ABOUT-01 / DOSSIER</span></div>
          <div class="hero-file__row"><span>READ</span><span>02 MIN 10 SEC</span></div>
          <div class="hero-file__row"><span>STATE</span><span class="hero-file__live"><i></i>PUBLIC</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-hero__card">
          <div class="id-card panel" data-tilt>
            <span class="hud-corner hud-corner--tl" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="hud-corner hud-corner--tr" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="hud-corner hud-corner--bl" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="hud-corner hud-corner--br" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <div class="id-card__scan" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="id-card__head mono">
              <span>ID / MISIRO-01</span>
              <span class="id-card__status"><i></i>ONLINE</span>
            </div>
            <div class="id-card__avatar" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="id-card__glyph">M</span>
              <span class="id-card__ring" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="id-card__ring id-card__ring--b" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="id-card__meta mono">
              <span>ROLE — FRONT-END</span>
              <span>LOC — 31.23°N / 121.47°E</span>
              <span>EST — {SITE.startYear}</span>
